</div>


<div id="ace" class="block split-feature style-alt align alt media-left">
  <div class="block-wrap">
    <div class="split-feature-inner">
              <div class="img-wrap">
          <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/uploads/personcheckinglevel-768x512.jpg" alt="Student in science lab">
        </div>
      
      <div class="content">
                  <h2>
            Accelerate your learning          </h2>
        
                  <div class="description-wrap cf">
            <p>Begin your college education in high school with our Accelerated College Enrollment (ACE) Program, featuring discounted tuition, challenging coursework and transferability to other universities.</p>
<ul>
<li>Earn high school and college credits at the same time</li>
<li>Pay a lower tuition rate (one third the cost)</li>
<li>Learn at your high school or on a GCC campus</li>
<li>Complete challenging and motivating coursework</li>
</ul>
<div class="link-group"><p class="link-wrap"><a href="/resources/high-school-students/accelerated-college-enrollment/" class="btn"><span>View ACE Programs</span></a></p></div>
          </div>
        
              </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


