							<div class="content">
																	<div class="title">
																					<h3>Encore &#8211; A Season to Shine</h3>
																			</div>
																									<div class="content-desc cf">
										<p>Encore is the Foundation’s signature holiday community engagement and fundraising event here at Genesee. Encore has a distinctive 30-year tradition and has raised significant funds in support of student scholarships. Encore brings together hundreds of community leaders and business organizations committed to our students and our future.</p>
<p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact the Foundation office at (585) 345-6809 or <a href="mailto:foundation@genesee.edu"><span class="s1">foundation@genesee.edu</span></a>.</p>
									</div>
															</div>

																								<div class="link-wrap">
